// Map coordinates for the Territory Navigator, Election Day Ops Center, and
// Command Center.
//
// IMPORTANT — provenance: state-level coordinates and flagship-LGA-seat
// coordinates are real (well-known reference points — state capitals / LGA
// headquarters). Coordinates for wards and polling units are NOT surveyed
// positions — we don't have a sourced dataset of real ward/PU centroids.
// They are generated by spreading points in a small ring around their real
// parent location, purely so the map has something sensible to render.
// Never present these sub-LGA points as surveyed/official locations — the
// underlying names and INEC codes for the 6 flagship LGAs are real; the pin
// positions for wards/PUs within them are illustrative layout only.

